---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const seo = {
  title: "Net Worth Tracker India | Assets & Goals | Arthavi",
  description: "Calculate and track your Net Worth in INR. Aggregate Mutual Funds, Stocks, and more to see your total financial picture. Privacy-first Indian wealth tracker.",
};
---
<Layout title={seo.title} description={seo.description} keywords="net worth tracker India, wealth tracker app, personal finance dashboard India, asset allocation tracker" schema={JSON.stringify({"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","name":"Net Worth Tracker India","description":"Calculate and track your Net Worth in INR. Aggregate Mutual Funds, Stocks, and more to see your total financial picture.","url":"https://arthavi.com/net-worth-tracker-india"})} breadcrumb={{items:[{name:"Home",url:"https://arthavi.com/"},{name:"Net Worth Tracker",url:"https://arthavi.com/net-worth-tracker-india"}]}}>

    

    <main class="container">
        <section class="page-header fade-in">
            <h1>Net Worth Tracker for Indian Investors</h1>
            <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 1.25rem; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
                More than just a stock ticker. See your total wealth in one place.
            </p>
            <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
                <a href="https://app.arthavi.com" class="btn btn-primary">Calculate Net Worth</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <article class="prose fade-in delay-100">
            <h2>Why Net Worth Matters</h2>
            <p>Tracking individual stock prices is noise. Tracking your <strong>Net Worth</strong> is signal. It is the
                single most important metric for financial independence (FIRE) in India.</p>

            <h2>Aggregation: The Full Picture</h2>
            <p>Arthavi acts as a central hub for:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Mutual Funds:</strong> Equity, Debt, and Hybrid funds via your investment statement.</li>
                <li><strong>Stocks:</strong> Direct equity holdings in NSE/BSE.</li>
                <li><strong>Cash & Liquid Assets:</strong> (Coming soon)</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Performance Over Time</h2>
            <p>Visualize your wealth growth chart. See how your asset allocation shifts between Equity and Debt over
                time, helping you rebalance your portfolio effectively.</p>

            <div style="margin-top: 3rem; text-align: center;">
                <h3>Start your wealth journey</h3>
                <a href="https://app.arthavi.com" class="btn btn-primary">Track Net Worth</a>
            </div>
        </article>
    </main>

    
    

</Layout>
